"Leeter-zis is an Artonan master wizard of collective casting and a professional celebrant."
"He goes shirtless and shoeless in white harem pants, with a striped back and unwashed hair."
"He had attended celebrations for 854 days straight to build a communal spell."
"At the Here-to-There he made spell-filled koobas and painted everyone with coral paint and spit."
"He calls Alden tall Ryeh-b't and Stuart a wonderful young ingredient."
"He helped Stu raise his greeting-house ritual, gathering hundreds of volunteers to bless him."
